extends baseEmail
block content
    p Hi #{firstName},
        p Forget your password? Send a Patch request on this #{url} with new password and passwordconfirm. If not requested by you please ignore this message
        p We're all a big familiy here, so make sure to upload your user photo so we get to know you a bit better!
        table.btn.btn-primary(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
                tr
                    td(align='left')
                        table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
                            tbody
                                tr
                                    td
                                        a(href=url, target='_blank') Reset Password
        p If you need any help with booking your next tour, please don't hesitate to contact me!
        p Aditya Dev